    &lt;p&gt;We identified that &lt;code&gt;proc-macro-en&lt;/code&gt; contained the same build script as
&lt;code&gt;proc-macro1&lt;/code&gt; and it was part of the same supply chain attack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This crate had one single version published at 2026-08-20. The crate was
removed from crates.io and related user account was locked.&lt;/p&gt;
